      "label": "Students and graduates of higher vocational education, by sex, educational orientation, study region, study rate, form of study, programme length and  type of degree. Year 2005-2025",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2026-03-20T07:00:00Z",
      "link": {
